  Description: Prerequisite Region - Eye of Dread Rumors abound that your family
    is cursed. While that would explain several unfortunate events in your family
    history, you may or may not believe it. Regardless, odd coincidences plague your
    lineage, and perhaps even appear in your own life, and you have become used to
    spotting strangeness around you. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to
    Intelligence or Charisma , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained
    in the Occultism skill and the Curse Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Oddity
    Identification] skill feat.
